## Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root (never commit this file).

| Variable | Description | Example / Default | Required |
|---|---|---|---|
| `NODE_ENV` | Runtime environment | `development` / `production` / `uat` | Yes |
| `PORT` | Port the server listens on | `3000` | Yes |
| `MONGODB_URI` | MongoDB connection string | `mongodb://user:pass@mongo:27017/3mmile?authSource=admin` | Yes |
| `MONGO_USERNAME` | MongoDB root username (used by Docker Compose) | — | Yes (Docker) |
| `MONGO_PASSWORD` | MongoDB root password (used by Docker Compose) | — | Yes (Docker) |
| `REDIS_URL` | Redis connection string | `redis://redis:6379` | Yes |
| `ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET` | Secret used to sign access tokens | long random string | Yes |
| `REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET` | Secret used to sign refresh tokens | long random string, different from the access secret | Yes |
| `TOKEN_PREFIX` | Authorization header scheme | `Bearer` | Yes |
| `API_PUBLIC_URL` | Base URL used to build uploaded-file URLs | `http://localhost:8082` | Yes |
| `CORS_ORIGINS` | Comma-separated list of allowed origins | `http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000` | Yes |
| `API_SERVER_NAME` | Server name used by the Nginx template | `localhost` | Docker only |
| `API_UPSTREAM_HOST` | Upstream host used by the Nginx template | `3mMile-app` | Docker only |
| `RUN_DB_SEED` | Run the seed script automatically on container start | `false` (set `true` for dev/staging only) | No |
| `SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL` | Email for the seeded admin account | `admin@example.com` | No |
| `SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD` | Password for the seeded admin account | randomly generated if unset | No |
| `MONGO_EXPRESS_USERNAME` | Mongo Express basic-auth username | — | Only with `dev-tools` profile |
| `MONGO_EXPRESS_PASSWORD` | Mongo Express basic-auth password | — | Only with `dev-tools` profile |
| `CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME` | Cloudinary account cloud name | — | Yes (for uploads) |
| `CLOUDINARY_API_KEY` | Cloudinary API key | — | Yes (for uploads) |
| `CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET` | Cloudinary API secret | — | Yes (for uploads) |

